      ],
      "lines": [
        "Nothing in the app calls 2 routes outside OCS. Looked for: a route name or a path in the PHP source and the templates, in 8 files of the frontend source and in the navigation of info.xml. A route stays behind when the frontend stops calling it. A route that only a client outside the app calls shows here as well, unless its method allows requests from other origins (CORS).",
        "  PATCH /index.php/apps/spiresearch/api/note/language  spiresearch.documentapi.setnotelanguage  lib/Controller/DocumentApiController.php:176",
        "  GET /index.php/apps/spiresearch/  spiresearch.search.home  lib/Controller/SearchController.php:37"
      ]
    },
